    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-portfolio-resume/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Prime Portfolio Resume is a professional and modern theme designed to showcase portfolios with both style and functionality, enhanced with relevant features such as a portfolio template, CV template, resume layout, creative showcase options, personal branding tools, digital portfolio styling, one-page portfolio structures, responsive portfolio layouts, grid gallery and masonry gallery displays, slider showcase options, skills showcase blocks, services section customization, contact form integration through Contact Form 7, lightbox gallery support, animation effects, and a clean minimal portfolio design suitable for a wide range of creatives. With a sleek, minimalist aesthetic, it caters to artists, photographers, designers, developers, freelancers, creative agencies, and professionals seeking to highlight their work. The theme’s responsive design ensures seamless viewing across all devices, providing an optimized user experience and improved accessibility. Its customizable layout enables users to create personalized portfolios that reflect their unique style and expertise, supporting various portfolio types such as graphic design, web design, photography, illustration, animation, and multimedia content. Key features include a portfolio showcase with grid or masonry layouts, an easy-to-use portfolio builder tool requiring no coding knowledge, and the ability to effortlessly add and update portfolio examples. For professionals in marketing, content creation, filmmaking, and digital media, the theme includes specialized layouts for presenting multimedia content, including videos, interactive projects, and animations. This versatility makes it ideal for displaying work samples, achievements, client testimonials, services, career highlights, and project details in a compelling manner. With built-in SEO optimization, social media integration, and polished visual elements, Prime Portfolio Resume serves as the perfect solution for anyone looking to create a standout online CV or professional profile that captures skills and accomplishments with clarity, impact, and style."
    },
